# Menuyukti feature glossary (pointer)

**Workflow presets** are built-in workflow **import** payloads: JSON under `apps/web/lib/workflows/presets/`, registered in `apps/web/lib/workflows/presets/index.ts` as `WORKFLOW_IMPORT_PRESETS` (shape matches `workflowImportPayload` from `apps/graphql/workflow_export_schema.json`). They appear in the import dialog and new-workflow preset pickers.

For aliases, preset IDs, key symbols, and UI touchpoints, read the canonical table in [`.agents/menuyukti-features.md`](../../.agents/menuyukti-features.md). Add new features there; keep this rule as a short pointer only.
